---
import TextPageLayout from '../layouts/TextPageLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<TextPageLayout title="Privacy Policy" path="/privacy" description="How WiseMove Senior Advisors collects, uses and protects the information families share with us.">
  <p>
    <strong>[PLACEHOLDER: Have your privacy policy written or reviewed by a qualified professional before launch.]</strong>
    The outline below shows what it typically covers.
  </p>
  <h2>Our commitment</h2>
  <p>We never sell your information. [Confirm and expand on how you handle family information.]</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>[Describe what visitors share through forms (name, phone, email, ZIP, care details), and what is collected automatically (analytics, cookies).]</p>
  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>[Describe how information is used, e.g. to contact you and to share relevant details with communities only with your permission.]</p>
  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>[List service providers (form backend, analytics) and when information is shared with communities.]</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>[Explain how people can request access, correction or deletion of their information.]</p>
  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call {site.phoneDisplay}.</p>
</TextPageLayout>
